    "detailed_description": "Build, Create, PLAY! Experience the ultimate convergence of creativity and technological engineering in TinkerTech. Inspired by model kit building, TinkerTech allows you to design, construct, and mobilize builds made out of many individual blocks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have the power to create anything from cars, robots, walking characters, or even buildings. Each block you use can be customized, giving you the control to paint, sculpt, and design unique creations. Advanced users even have the option to design 3D models for use in-game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTinkerTech also allows you to host multiplayer rooms for other players to join. Display your creations and hang out, race, or battle!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFuture versions of TinkerTech will add support for Logic gate systems, scripting, and much more!",
    "about_the_game": "Build, Create, PLAY! Experience the ultimate convergence of creativity and technological engineering in TinkerTech. Inspired by model kit building, TinkerTech allows you to design, construct, and mobilize builds made out of many individual blocks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have the power to create anything from cars, robots, walking characters, or even buildings. Each block you use can be customized, giving you the control to paint, sculpt, and design unique creations. Advanced users even have the option to design 3D models for use in-game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTinkerTech also allows you to host multiplayer rooms for other players to join. Display your creations and hang out, race, or battle!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFuture versions of TinkerTech will add support for Logic gate systems, scripting, and much more!",
